          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Will the Ameda Universal Breast Pump Travel Case fit all Ameda pumps?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! The Ameda Universal Breast Pump Travel Case is designed to perfectly fit both the Ameda Mya Joy and Mya Joy PLUS pumps, along with their accessories. Its flexible compartments and ample space provide convenient storage for your pump, flanges, bottles, and charger—keeping everything organized and ready for use wherever you go.</p>"
